    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ERICA: That tree’s pretty cool, huh?\nMAGGIE: It’s breathtaking.\nMAGGIE: You’re a real hero, Louie.",
      "ERICA: There’s a festival on Saturday that we could hit, see what this town’s all about.\nMAGGIE: Okay.\nERICA: We can grab breakfast somewhere first and then just kinda wander. Good Charlotte is playing.\nMAGGIE: That’s depressing.",
      "MAGGIE: The service here sucks.\nERICA: Yeah I noticed that. We can switch it up if it’s bad around town.\nMAGGIE: I’m good. You can have mine.\nERICA: You should eat, Mags.",
      "MAGGIE: Thanks.\nMAGGIE: Hey, do you need a hand?\nSMALL GIRL: Yeah, maybe. It didn’t charge right last night so it’s low on juice.\nMAGGIE: Here, hold up. I’ll get ya.",
      "HALEY: You do have a nice ass.\nHALEY: I noticed it in the hallway, I’m very perceptive. I’m not a lesbian or anything but you have shape. Who are you? You’re new. In April? Which…\nMAGGIE: No. I’m Maggie. Yeah, I, today’s my first day. I transferred schools.\nHALEY: Sucks. I was new last year too."
    ]
  },
